<title>USA: Cotton States sets 25 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Cotton States sets 25 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cotton States Life Insurance Co said on Monday it declared a 25 percent stock dividend to be distributed on April 30 to stockholders of record April 15.</p>
<p>After payment of the stock dividend, Cotton States will have approximately 4,265,000 common shares outstanding. Stockholders will receive certificates representing one additional share for every four common shares held at record date.</p>
<p>Cotton States shares were trading at 13-1/8 on Monday, down 1/2 on the day.</p>
